  real right and left hand.
    m1 staff 2 C5 half, B4 half;              staff 3 C3 whole.
    m2 staff 1 A4 quarter, B4 quarter, C5 half (the ossia);
       staff 2 A4 quarter, G4 quarter, F4 half; staff 3 F2 whole.
